	(text "CAN1 POWERED: fit JP5 + JP6 together on the can-ssr bus\n(up to 4 can-ssr at ~0.2 A each; F10 2 A hold).\nF10 and JP5/JP6 sit at the RACK | CAN1 boundary on the board."
